{"id":"n38033-1-7","stage":4,"title":"끌어올리다 · 拉上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38033-1-7-1","ko":"그물에 묵직한 게 느껴지는데요.","zh":"我觉得网里有个很重的东西呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그물에","meaning":"网，网具","explanation":"그물：网，网具；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"그물","audio":"/audio/7b6532aafd5e46c45654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36405","senseId":"1","lemma":"그물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그물에","audio":"/audio/9c78dfc2dc30dc6586ac.mp3"}},{"text":"묵직한","meaning":"沉甸甸","explanation":"묵직하다：沉甸甸；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"묵직하다","audio":"/audio/a23c70eb2b925d8d72d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57533","senseId":"1","lemma":"묵직하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묵직한","audio":"/audio/95065c56c6f0e68a8ead.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"느껴지는데요.","meaning":"认为，觉得，感到；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"느끼다：认为，觉得，感到；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"4","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느껴지는데요","audio":"/audio/d3e7db3f6c7e381841a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7b6532aafd5e46c4","term":"그물","zh":"网，网具","audio":"/audio/7b6532aafd5e46c45654.mp3","entryId":"36405","definition":"为了捕捉鱼或动物而用绳子、线或铁丝等编成的道具。","pronunciation":["그물"]},{"id":"a23c70eb2b925d8d","term":"묵직하다","zh":"沉甸甸","audio":"/audio/a23c70eb2b925d8d72d2.mp3","entryId":"57533","definition":"体积稍大的东西比想象的重很多。","pronunciation":["묵찌카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"认为，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"感觉或认识到特定的对象或情况如何。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8c61393e035ff3f47c52.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38033-1-7-2","ko":"빨리 그물을 물 위로 끌어올리자.","zh":"快把网拉到水面上来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"그물을","meaning":"那个；水","explanation":"그：那个；물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"},{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"2","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그물을","audio":"/audio/78deb1cd656f9ddcb47f.mp3"}},{"text":"물","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"2","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}},{"text":"위로","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위로","audio":"/audio/3fd4bdbe77c71ceac16d.mp3"}},{"text":"끌어올리자.","meaning":"拉上，提起，抬高","explanation":"끌어올리다：拉上，提起，抬高；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"끌어올리다","audio":"/audio/279f00a7ff1e5a776992.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38033","senseId":"1","lemma":"끌어올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끌어올리자","audio":"/audio/09e447c9831bd11d32fc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"湖、河、海等。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"比某基准更高的一方；或指比中间更高的一方。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"279f00a7ff1e5a77","term":"끌어올리다","zh":"拉上，提起，抬高","audio":"/audio/279f00a7ff1e5a776992.mp3","entryId":"38033","definition":"抓住或拉扯着使其上来。","pronunciation":["끄ː러올리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3bd6ad0f8f8e00bf5d67.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38033","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得网里有个很重的东西呢。","快把网拉到水面上来吧。","你的眼睛都红充血了啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得网里有个很重的东西呢。","快把网拉到水面上来吧。","你的眼睛都红充血了啊。"],"answer":1}]}
